	.home-head .eyebrow::after { background: var(--iris); }
	/* Descendant selectors, not bare .home-word / .hw-year: the wordmark's own rules live
	   further down this stylesheet, so at equal specificity THEY would win. Kept scoped
	   even though both now resolve to ink — the particle canvas samples this computed
	   colour, so whatever wins here is what the dust is painted in. */
